<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all four auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all four auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned all four auctions whereby it had sought to drain 2.208 billion pesos from the secondary market on Friday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    750 million    27 days   20.89 pct</p>
<p>    750 million    26 days   20.67 pct</p>
<p>    510 million    20 days   20.50 pct</p>
<p>    198 million     3 days   19.25 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
